OL,3,GNEWSABritish paratrooper killed by
OL,4,Aexplosion in Ukraine, coroner rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British paratrooper was killed by an
OL,7,Fexplosion while assisting Ukrainian
OL,8,Ftroops in the war with Russia, a
OL,9,Fcoroner has ruled.
OL,11,FAn inquest, conducted partly in secret
OL,12,Fthis week, into L/Cpl George Hooley's
OL,13,Fdeath found he had "sustained multiple
OL,14,Finjuries from an explosion" on 6
OL,15,FDecember 2025.
OL,17,FHooley, 28, died from his injuries in a
OL,18,Fhospital in Kyiv three days later - the
OL,19,Ffirst British service member to die in
OL,20,FUkraine since Russia's full-scale
OL,21,Finvasion in February 2022.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
