OL,3,GNEWSABritish paratrooper killed by
OL,4,Aexplosion in Ukraine, coroner rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarren Salter, senior coroner for
OL,7,FOxfordshire, said he had been provided
OL,8,Fwith "limited evidence" about the
OL,9,Fcircumstances and cause of the
OL,10,Fexplosion but Hooley's death was "not
OL,11,Fsuspicious".
